#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:2 79e3b0e6c391458d9b3aa86e50c79ac4
msgid "_`CMakeLists Configuration`"
msgstr "CMakeLists 配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:5 95515399fa2046e1937c02c31718919c
msgid "_`Overview`"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:7 e179c3ee5143484287911b22face0893
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The CMakeLists.txt file is the core build configuration file for the "
"stereo_vision project, responsible for project building, dependency "
"management, and module compilation."
msgstr "CMakeLists.txt 文件是 fcpp 项目的核心构建配置文件，负责项目构建、依赖管理和模块编译。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:11 17b8f42b29304ce29d44324bfb8e74a6
msgid "_`Key Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:13 cf5d67ff316e4a1483d80c7f799f171c
msgid "Project initialization and metadata parsing"
msgstr "项目初始化与元数据解析"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:14 ea437a251f4c46f897c499408613a174
msgid "Automatic source file collection and target creation"
msgstr "自动源文件收集与目标创建"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:15 27d1a66e55a44ab79bac6cb88e26e33d
msgid "Dependency management and linking"
msgstr "依赖管理与链接"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:16 4812dd051f7d4ac58adce3ae9292b5bf
msgid "C++ module support configuration"
msgstr "C++ 模块支持配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:17 ac9a449462d54e809b66aa0f9021b036
msgid "Installation rule definition"
msgstr "安装规则定义"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:20 c86c142c2caf45a2936cad7beb142300
msgid "_`Main Configurations`"
msgstr "主要配置项"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:22 b687590a7bc740e8adc674eaa47e5847
msgid ""
"The CMake configuration automatically reads project information from "
"metadata.json, collects source files from include and src directories, "
"creates separate static libraries for C and C++ components, and "
"configures module support for C++23 and above."
msgstr ""
"CMake 配置会自动从 metadata.json 读取项目信息，从 include 和 src 目录收集源文件，为 C 和 C++ "
"组件分别创建静态库，并配置 C++23 及以上版本的模块支持。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:26 34eca8f2b4af4c01a65c6c3eeb40c46a
msgid ""
"Platform-specific module compilation is handled with appropriate settings"
" for MSVC (.ixx files) and GCC/Clang (.cppm files). The configuration "
"also includes installation rules for libraries and headers."
msgstr ""
"平台特定的模块编译通过针对 MSVC (.ixx 文件) 和 GCC/Clang (.cppm 文件) "
"的适当设置进行处理。该配置还包含库和头文件的安装规则。"

